#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md:178
msgid ""
"When a document is classified, each error names the entry, its pipeline "
"and its page:"
msgstr ""
"Quando si classifica un documento, ogni errore nomina la voce, la sua "
"pipeline e la sua pagina:"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "Message ends with"
msgstr "Il messaggio finisce con"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "`gave two different formats: '…' and '…'`"
msgstr "`gave two different formats: '…' and '…'`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "one pipeline producing two names"
msgstr "una pipeline che produce due nomi"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "`returned …, not a document class`"
msgstr "`returned …, not a document class`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "a deserializer returning something other than a string or `None`"
msgstr ""
"un deserializzatore che restituisce qualcosa che non è una stringa né "
"`None`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "`gave '…', which is not a format of the repository`"
msgstr "`gave '…', which is not a format of the repository`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "a complete name `formats.csv` does not declare"
msgstr "un nome completo che `formats.csv` non dichiara"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "`gave '…', which no format of the repository refines`"
msgstr "`gave '…', which no format of the repository refines`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-python.md
msgid "a partial name no format falls under"
msgstr "un nome parziale sotto cui non ricade nessun formato"

